# Alembic Migrations
#
# Alembic auto-generates migration scripts based on declarative_base.
# This directory holds generated version scripts.
#
# Core files (pre-generated):
#   - env.py: Alembic configuration and environment setup
#
# Generated files (one per schema change):
#   - versions/: Auto-generated migration scripts (001_initial_schema.py, etc.)
#
# Usage:
#   alembic revision --autogenerate -m "Add new column"
#   alembic upgrade head
